<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan to issue T$11 bln NCDs on Monday.</title>
<headline>Taiwan to issue T$11 bln NCDs on Monday.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's central bank said on Monday it would issue T$11 billion in three-month negotiable certificates of deposit later in the day.</p>
<p>Bids would close at 15.00 local time (0700 GMT), a central bank official said.</p>
</text>
